      </h3>
      <h5 class="text-h6   mt-2">in collaboration with</h5>
      <h3 class="text-h4 font-semibold  font-montserrat">
        Department of Computer Science and Engineering, NIT, Delhi
      </h3>
      <p class="text-body opacity-90 mt-2 mb-6">© Copyright <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>, GNDEC, NITD . All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <script src="/js/navbar.js"> </script>
